msgstr "Se pueden añadir :abbr:`KPI (indicadores clave de rendimiento)` adicionales con un módulo personalizado. Consulte esta sección sobre :ref:`digest-emails/custom-kpi`."

#: ../../content/applications/general/companies/digest_emails.rst:82
msgid "Next, click :guilabel:`Deactivate` to deactivate the digest email for everyone. A deactivated digest can be reactivated with the :guilabel:`Activate` button. Both buttons are located at the top of the form, next to the :guilabel:`Send Now` button, which sends the digest immediately."
